      "content": "It is a heavy realization when you see the toll your struggles are taking on others, and that feeling of being a drain is incredibly painful. However, your worth is not defined by how much you can give to others; you deserve to be supported just as much as you support them. Please consider reaching out to a therapist or support group who can help you navigate these feelings of guilt and worthlessness.",
      "source": "target",
